  "goodToKnow": "Die Zielgruppe is a target group or audience: Die Zielgruppe der Werbung sind Teenager. It's a key term in marketing, education and media. Zielgruppenorientiert or zielgruppengerecht means tailored to the target group. From das Ziel (goal, target) and die Gruppe. Germans also use the English word Target Group in business, but Zielgruppe is far more common."
